# Pay3 environment variables

## Neon PostgreSQL (required for persistent storage)

See **`docs/DATABASE.md`** for full setup.

```env
# Pooled — app runtime (-pooler in hostname)
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@ep-xxxx-pooler.region.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require

# Direct — Prisma db push / migrations (no -pooler)
DIRECT_URL=postgresql://user:pass@ep-xxxx.region.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require
```

Copy into **`packages/database/.env`** and **`apps/api/.env`**.

## API (`apps/api`)

```env
PORT=4000
WEB_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000
NODE_ENV=development
DATABASE_URL=...
DIRECT_URL=...
SMART_ACCOUNT_ENCRYPTION_KEY=dev-only-change-me-32chars-min
STELLAR_NETWORK_PASSPHRASE=Test SDF Network ; September 2015
STELLAR_HORIZON_URL=https://horizon-testnet.stellar.org
STELLAR_RPC_URL=https://soroban-testnet.stellar.org
# RELAYER_SECRET=S...   # optional jar seeder + contract-mode fee payer
# MAINNET_JAR_SEED_XLM=2
# SOROSWAP_API_KEY=     # swap quotes + execute (match SOROSWAP_NETWORK to Stellar)
# SOROSWAP_NETWORK=testnet
# PAY3_ALLOWED_WASM_HASHES=
# x402 demo payee G-address (API returns 402 until paid)
# X402_DEMO_PAYEE_G=G...
# X402_DEMO_AMOUNT=0.1
# Mainnet (switch all three together if needed):
# STELLAR_NETWORK_PASSPHRASE=Public Global Stellar Network ; September 2015
# STELLAR_HORIZON_URL=https://horizon.stellar.org
# STELLAR_RPC_URL=https://mainnet.sorobanrpc.com
# SOROSWAP_NETWORK=mainnet
```

## Web (`apps/web`)

```env
# Same-origin proxy to the API (keeps login cookies across refresh)
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=/api
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
# HTTPS origin baked into phone QR codes (so scanners don't need the same Wi‑Fi)
NEXT_PUBLIC_QR_ORIGIN=https://paythreewallet.vercel.app
NEXT_PUBLIC_STELLAR_NETWORK=Test SDF Network ; September 2015
# Optional — WalletConnect Cloud project id for Freighter Mobile / Lobstr
NEXT_PUBLIC_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=
```

Optional: `API_PROXY_ORIGIN=http://localhost:4000` if the API runs elsewhere (used by Next rewrites).
